This directory contains the CrossDesk Web Client, licensed under LGPL-3.0.
It is served as a separate static application under /crossdesk/web/ and is not
linked into iFlyGo's MIT-licensed Go code.

Upstream: https://github.com/kunkundi/crossdesk-web-client
License: see LICENSE in this directory.

Modifications by iFlyGo: `frame_view.js` renders the pure-Go agent's
chunked JPEG DataChannel frames; `audio_pcm.js` plays the agent's PCM audio
channel; `web_client.js` binds binary frame/audio messages, wires the audio
button and resets state on teardown. These modifications remain under
LGPL-3.0 as part of this separate web application.
